"entity": {
"name": "Figure Technology Solutions, Inc.",
"description": "Figure Technology Solutions, Inc. is a blockchain-native capital marketplace, which engages in connecting origination, funding, and secondary market activity. It operates through the following segments: FTI, Markets, and Other. The FTI segment offers Figure Connect which generates ecosystem and technology fees, and originates, sells, and securitizes home equity line of credit (HELOC) loans that it services. The Markets segment utilizes blockchain technology to develop an exchange for digital assets and credit, with new product offerings including providing interest-bearing stable coin deposits. The company was founded by Michael Scott Cagney and June Ou in 2018 and is headquartered in Reno, NV.",
"rbics_econ": "Finance",
"rbics_sector": "Banking",
"rbics_subsector": "Mortgage Banking",
"rbics_indgrp": "Mortgage Banking",
"country_of_risk": "US"
